Complexity Comparison
Approach	Technique	Time	Extra Space	Comment
1	Collect all nodes + second pass	O(n)	O(n)	Simple but redundant
2	Recursive DFS	O(n)	O(h)	⭐ Best standard
3	Iterative DFS	O(n)	O(n) worst	Good iterative option
4	BFS — your code	O(n)	O(w)	⭐ Good
